><issue>9</issue><elocation-id>e240</elocation-id><history><date date-type="received"><day>5</day><month>7</month><year>2007</year></date><date date-type="accepted"><day>5</day><month>7</month><year>2007</year></date></history><copyright-statement>Copyright: &#x000a9; 2007 Brennand et al. This is an open-access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution License, which permits unrestricted use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original author and source are credited.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2007</copyright-year><related-article xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pbio.0050163" related-article-type="corrected-article" xlink:title="Research Article" vol="5" page="e163" id="RA1" ext-link-type="doi"><article-title>All &#x003b2; Cells Contribute Equally to Islet Growth and Maintenance</article-title></related-article><counts><page-count count="1"/></counts><custom-meta-wrap><custom-meta><meta-name>citation</meta-name><meta-value>Brennand K, Huangfu D, Melton D (2007) Correction: All &#x003b2; Cells Contribute Equally to Islet Growth and Maintenance. PLoS Biol 5(9): e240. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pbio.0050240">10.1371/journal.pbio.0050240</ext-link></meta-value></custom-meta></custom-meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>Correction for:</p><p>Brennand K, Huangfu D, Melton D (2007) All &#x003b2; cells contribute equally to islet growth and maintenance. PLoS Biol 5(7): e163. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pbio.0050163">10.1371/journal.pbio.0050163</ext-link></p><p>The labels in Figure 2B indicating the &#x0201c;Pulse&#x0201d; and &#x0201c;No Pulse&#x0201d; FACS conditions for the Rosa26-rtTA;tetO-H2BGFP cells were switched. Labeled properly, the middle left panel should be titled &#x0201c;No Pulse,&#x0201d; and the bottom left panel should be titled &#x0201c;Pulse.&#x0201d;</p></body></article>